# Scoped private registries (FontAwesome Pro + the @cdecaire/sable GitHub Packages
# feed). Auth tokens are NOT committed — they come from env vars: Vercel injects
# them at build time, and locally they're persistent user env vars. Registry
# mappings are listed FIRST, before the token lines, so a missing token can never
# drop a registry route (pnpm stops reading the file at the first unresolved ${VAR}).
@fortawesome:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
@cdecaire:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/
//npm.fontawesome.com/:_authToken=${FONTAWESOME_TOKEN}
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
